  m_Name: FirstNPC_Quest1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  initialDialog:
  - Hey, are you okay? You've hit the shore unconscious and I found you lying over
    there while I was gathering coconuts.
  - I'm Samantha. I'm one of the denizens of this island, stuck here for months.
    Me and the others built a camp with the island's resources to survive.
  - Come on, join me at the camp so I can introduce you to the others. And bring
    5 coconuts with you, will you?
  acceptOption: Sure, I'm happy I'm not stranded all alone.
  acceptAnswer: Great! See you at the camp. Thanks a lot.
  declineOption: I'm sorry but I don't know you. And I think I need a moment to gather
    my thoughts.
  declineAnswer: Oh, I see. You're right, I'm sorry for rushing things up. Let me
    know if you change your mind.
  comebackAfterDecline: Hey, have you changed your mind yet?
  comebackInProgress: You can find the coconuts under the palm trees.
  comebackCompleted: Oh, thanks a lot! You've gathered just enough, thanks for your
    efforts. Here, keep some for yourself. The others probably gathered more than
    us anyway.
  finalWords: Welcome to the Chronicle Island.
  rewardItem1: Coconut
  rewardItem1Amount: 2
  rewardItem2: 
  firstRequirementItem: Coconut
  firstRequirementAmount: 5
  secondRequirementItem: 
  secondRequirementAmount: 0
